{"seq":21,"trial_id":"installer-cc-codex-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/si-01-marrow-agrisupply-site/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-02T14:49:02.469Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"254f0b84fd75644e2d2190e0f1e37ea1b18e981b126b3d116dbd28cd7126782b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Pree, that store is Pine Crossing. On 9 Jun you posted here that the morning receiver at Pine Crossing saw only the afternoon shift on the appointment screen. A driver had shown up at 7:10, and Hollis said they'd check the shift template. I couldn't find a separate site code or address for Pine Crossing in this channel or the shared files, so if the sheet needs a site ID, it isn't anywhere I can see.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791987000.000127","thread_ts":"1791987000.000126"}}
